### ================================================================
### Data Reconciliation Service — HTTP Request Collection
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### ================================================================

### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Connection Management
### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Register GCP MongoDB connection
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "gcp-mongo-prod",
  "dbType": "MONGODB",
  "connectionString": "mongodb://gcp-host1:27017,gcp-host2:27017/?replicaSet=rs0",
  "clusterLabel": "gcp",
  "username": "admin",
  "passwordEncrypted": "encrypted-password-placeholder",
  "properties": {
    "database": "orders_db",
    "readPreference": "primaryPreferred"
  },
  "enabled": true
}

### 1.2 Register HIC MongoDB connection
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "hic-mongo-prod",
  "dbType": "MONGODB",
  "connectionString": "mongodb://hic-host1:27017,hic-host2:27017/?replicaSet=rs0",
  "clusterLabel": "hic",
  "username": "admin",
  "passwordEncrypted": "encrypted-password-placeholder",
  "properties": {
    "database": "orders_db"
  },
  "enabled": true
}

### 1.3 Register PostgreSQL audit connection
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "audit-pg",
  "dbType": "POSTGRESQL",
  "connectionString": "jdbc:postgresql://postgres-host:5432/reconciliation",
  "clusterLabel": "audit",
  "username": "recon",
  "passwordEncrypted": "encrypted-password-placeholder",
  "enabled": true
}

### 1.4 List all connections
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections

### 1.5 Get connection by ID (replace {id} with actual UUID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections/{{connection-id}}

### 1.6 Update a connection
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections/{{connection-id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "gcp-mongo-prod-updated",
  "dbType": "MONGODB",
  "connectionString": "mongodb://gcp-new-host:27017/?replicaSet=rs0",
  "clusterLabel": "gcp",
  "enabled": true
}

### 1.7 Delete a connection
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections/{{connection-id}}

### 1.8 Validation: empty name should return 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/connections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "dbType": "MONGODB",
  "connectionString": "mongodb://host",
  "clusterLabel": "test"
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Sync Job Management
### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Create sync job (GCP → HIC) with collection mappings
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sync-jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "orders-gcp-to-hic",
  "sourceConnectionId": "{{gcp-connection-id}}",
  "targetConnectionId": "{{hic-connection-id}}",
  "parallelism": 4,
  "checkpointIntervalMs": 10000,
  "windowSizeMs": 30000,
  "mappings": [
    {
      "sourceCollection": "orders",
      "targetCollection": "orders",
      "timestampField": "updatedAt",
      "strategy": "LAST_WRITE_WINS",
      "windowSizeMs": 30000
    },
    {
      "sourceCollection": "customers",
      "targetCollection": "customers",
      "timestampField": "lastModified",
      "strategy": "SOURCE_PRIORITY",
      "strategyParams": {
        "priorityCluster": "gcp"
      },
      "windowSizeMs": 60000
    }
  ]
}

### 2.2 Create reverse sync job (HIC → GCP)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sync-jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "orders-hic-to-gcp",
  "sourceConnectionId": "{{hic-connection-id}}",
  "targetConnectionId": "{{gcp-connection-id}}",
  "parallelism": 4,
  "checkpointIntervalMs": 10000,
  "windowSizeMs": 30000,
  "mappings": [
    {
      "sourceCollection": "orders",
      "targetCollection": "orders",
      "timestampField": "updatedAt",
      "strategy": "LAST_WRITE_WINS",
      "windowSizeMs": 30000
    }
  ]
}

### 2.3 List all sync jobs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sync-jobs

### 2.4 Get sync job by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sync-jobs/{{job-id}}

### 2.5 Update sync job
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sync-jobs/{{job-id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "orders-gcp-to-hic-v2",
  "sourceConnectionId": "{{gcp-connection-id}}",
  "targetConnectionId": "{{hic-connection-id}}",
  "parallelism": 8,
  "checkpointIntervalMs": 20000,
  "windowSizeMs": 60000,
  "mappings": [
    {
      "sourceCollection": "orders",
      "targetCollection": "orders",
      "timestampField": "updatedAt",
      "strategy": "LAST_WRITE_WINS",
      "windowSizeMs": 60000
    }
  ]
}

### 2.6 Deploy sync job
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sync-jobs/{{job-id}}/deploy

### 2.7 Stop sync job
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sync-jobs/{{job-id}}/stop

### 2.8 Restart sync job
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sync-jobs/{{job-id}}/restart

### 2.9 Delete sync job (must be STOPPED first)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sync-jobs/{{job-id}}

### 2.10 Validation: missing source connection
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sync-jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "bad-job",
  "sourceConnectionId": "nonexistent-id",
  "targetConnectionId": "{{hic-connection-id}}",
  "parallelism": 1,
  "checkpointIntervalMs": 10000,
  "windowSizeMs": 30000,
  "mappings": []
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Conflict Resolution
### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Query all conflicts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts?page=0&size=20

### 3.2 Query conflicts by job ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts?syncJobId={{job-id}}&page=0&size=20

### 3.3 Query unresolved conflicts (manual review queue)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts?status=MANUAL_REQUIRED&page=0&size=10

### 3.4 Query conflicts by collection
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts?collectionName=orders&page=0&size=20

### 3.5 Query conflicts by time range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&page=0&size=20

### 3.6 Get conflict detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts/{{conflict-id}}

### 3.7 Manually resolve a conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conflicts/{{conflict-id}}/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conflictId": "{{conflict-id}}",
  "resolvedVersion": {
    "status": "shipped",
    "resolvedBy": "admin"
  },
  "resolutionDetail": "Admin reviewed: picked GCP version"
}


### ----------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Health & Metrics
### ----------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 4.2 Info
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info

### 4.3 Prometheus metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
